sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HQ as Authorized report operator
    actor Partner as Partner report requester/provider
    actor City as City authority
    participant API as Reports API
    participant DB as Operational data and report snapshots
    HQ->>API: Select disaster event, geographic scope and report sections
    API->>DB: Aggregate permitted recorded household/field/request evidence
    opt External-source synchronization requested
        API->>Partner: Request supported report data
        Partner-->>API: Available authorized data or pending/error response
    end
    API->>DB: Save report and lock selected snapshot
    API-->>HQ: Export PDF, CSV or Excel
    opt Manual escalation
        HQ->>City: Hand off exported situation report
        Note over HQ,City: Automatic city receipt/acknowledgment is not implemented
    end
    opt Partner requests a RESQPERATION report
        Partner->>API: Submit authenticated request and check status
        API-->>HQ: Present pending release decision
        HQ->>API: Accept or reject release
        API->>DB: Save decision and accepted frozen summary
        API-->>Partner: Authorized status and time-limited download when accepted
        Note over API,DB: external_report_requests is source-defined but absent locally
    end
    HQ->>API: Browse/export authorized archives or manage saved groups
    API->>DB: Retrieve scoped historical records
